abstract: >-
  Small-angle X-ray scattering study of ion-dependent organization of DPPC
  membranes in CuCl2, CoCl2, NiCl2, MnCl2 and FeCl3 solutions. Research
  conducted in the Raviv Group at the Hebrew University of Jerusalem in
  2017–2018. Includes the manuscript, processed scattering curves, spacing
  tables, figures and reproducible analysis.
keywords:
  - DPPC
  - lipid membranes
  - SAXS
  - ion adsorption
  - lamellar swelling
